oth and  in this video when I say main characters  I'm talking about Jon Snow and Daenerys  Targaryen now of course there are  several other main characters but when  it comes to the end I think Jon Snow and  Daenerys Targaryen  are going to be the key players that are  going to dictate how things are going to  end which is pretty obvious to most  people but I think for the final battle  to lend against the night king we may  have to see one of those characters or  both die in order to win that war and  since Jon Snow is the warrior that will  be on the battlefield who will more than  likely fight the night king one on  one at some point John snow may have to  sacrifice himself in order to save the  Rome which for me would be a very  bittersweet ending in itself John snow  has always been one of my favorite  characters so to see him die and never  come back would certainly be very bitter  but if he died in order to save the rest  of humanity that way life as they know  it could continue and restore itself  then that would be pretty sweet  but since the knight Kings true motives  haven't been revealed he's coming off as  the bad guy in the show he seems to  pretty much murder everyone in his past  in order to complete this mission that  he is on what's right now just appears  to be completely destroying humanity and  there is a chance that during that final  battle when and if John Snow has to  sacrifice himself in order to save  humanity he may even have to become the  new Knight King in order to do so now  that isn't a theory that I believe we  are going to see but it is definitely a  strong possibility which would also be  bittersweet to most people it would be  great to see Jon Snow when the war for  the dawn but to have to sacrifice  yourself and live out the rest of  eternity as the new knight King would  absolutely suck in my opinion another  bittersweet ending would be having all  the Starks die the stark family was the  first family we were introduced to in 