s we know it the Iron Throne  will no longer be something that people  seek in kill for it may even be  completely destroyed in places like  King's Landing and other major  territories will be completely destroyed  as well in Daenerys and John snow may  both end up dying in the end in order to  beat the night king but there will no  longer be a one world ruler power will  no longer reside in King's Landing  everyone will be able to be independent  and I think Jon Snow will be the key  player in defeating the evil of the  world and if he does die he's going to  make sure that the world is a better  place in the keys to the kingdom are  left in better hands than they were  before and I think Tyrion Lannister will  more than likely play a major role in  restoring Westeros and helping it grow  into a much better society than it has  ever been the end is going to be  bittersweet because of the amount of  casualties we see most of the main  characters we have grown to love are  going to die but ultimately the good  guys will win but life as we know it  will be completely decimated leaving the  final remaining characters the job of  rebuilding a better world we will see  that dream of spring the storm is going  to end the clouds will begin to break  and start to allow the Sun to shine  through and the snow will begin to melt  allowing crops to grow houses will be  rebuilt in society will begin anew  hopefully learning from all of it  mistakes from the past which will give  the future generations a chance to live  in a society that is better than ever  before now these are just a few of the  ways I can see this bittersweet ending  going down and like I said earlier I  will make another video before season 8  begins and which I will give my final  thoughts on the ending but comment below  and give me your thoughts because I'm  really curious to see how others may  think this story is going to end but  before I go I just want to give a quick  shout out the smoke screen and most of  you are probably familiar with his Game  of Thrones YouTube channel by now but  smokescreen was one of the very first  channels that I came across who was  doing Game of Thrones videos and he was  actually the guy that inspired me to  start making videos of my own and never  since I became a part of this community  I have reached out to Chris several  times and he has always been a great guy  and welcomed me with open arms and his  channel was much bigger than mine is  and even when I only had a few  subscribers he would still respond to  all of my comments and questions and for  that I really appreciate it so if you  aren't familiar with this channel please  go and check out his videos and  subscribe to his channels because his  content is really good and I know you  guys will love it too thank you for  taking the time to watch this video I  appreciate each and every one of you  guys and I can't wait to see some of  your ideas on this bittersweet ending so  I will see you guys down in the comment  section have a good day bye
 

